  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> is the first term of an infinite&nbsp;geometric progression&nbsp;whose sum is five, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> lies in the interval&nbsp;"
